{
  "title": "冰下前哨 · 监听频道",
  "steps": [
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "我们已经确认了你们的到来。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.01.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 5.962
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "欢迎来到克莱恩地下，Sharded。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.01.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 6.587
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "看来你们一直在监视我们。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.02.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 6.128
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "监测盟友的行动是必要的。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.03.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 6.587
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "我们必须确保合作计划能够顺利执行。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.03.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 7.087
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "Crux 在这片区域建立了军事基地，长期占据着重要设施。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.04.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 10.337
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "我们曾多次尝试将其驱逐，但均未取得预期成果。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.04.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 9.177
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "别废话了。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.05.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 5.545
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "我们早就发现了。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.05.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 5.337
    },
    {
      "team": "pioneer",
      "speaker": "先驱",
      "text": "……",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.06.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.pioneer",
      "duration": 4.795
    }
  ],
  "startDelay": 3,
  "titleKey": "cryon.radio.story.underice-outpost.title"
}
